# Student edit (`/students/:id/edit`)

Must match **`/students/register`** exactly: same `EnrollmentWizardChrome` stepper, same step order, same step components (`StudentDetailsStep`, `AcademicInfoStep`, `HealthInfoStep`, `GuardianInfoStep`, `AddressInfoStep`, review).

## Steps (same as register)

1. Student  
2. Academic (group required; bus select may appear in Academic `#after` only — not a separate tab)  
3. Health  
4. Guardian (`GuardianInfoStep` with `edit-mode`)  
5. Address  
6. Review → Save (not Register)

## Keep

- Brand **back** to `/students` in `#leading`
- `compact` on step bodies
- Per-step persist on Next; final Save on review
- `existingStudentId` on `StudentDetailsStep` so the student’s own civil ID does not lock the form

## Do not

- Do not use pill tabs (Student · Parents · Class · Bus)
- Do not invent a different step order or field set from register
- Do not drop guardian / academic / health / address
